Turn Thankful Moments Into Lasting Memories
-------------------------------------------

Bring gratitude into your Thanksgiving celebration with a handmade display =
everyone can help create. Combine vinyl lettering, colorful paper leaves, a=
nd personal messages to capture the people and moments that matter most.

[ ******Create Your Gratitude Wall**](https://www.silhouetteamerica.com/)


Three Quick & Easy Makes
------------------------

Turn thankfulness into something you can see and share. Add a meaningful me=
ssage, autumn details, and invite everyone to contribute.

###**Long Branch of Leaves**

[ **View Design**](https://www.silhouettedesignstore.com/long-branch-of-lea=
ves-rmi.html)


###**L****eaf garland**

[ **View Design**](https://www.silhouettedesignstore.com/leaf-garland-79561=
.html)


###**Thankful Stamp**

[ **View Design**](https://www.silhouettedesignstore.com/thankful-stamp-9qu=
.html)


###**Three Checks Before You Cut**


**I. Plan your display:**Measure your wall, frame, or board before sizing t=
he heading. Leave plenty of room for handwritten leaves and messages.


**II. Match the material:**Use removable adhesive vinyl for appropriate smo=
oth surfaces and cardstock for leaves, tags, and write-on pieces.


**III. Test and prepare:**Run a test cut, clean your display surface, and c=
heck removability on an inconspicuous area before applying vinyl.


